The '''Archaeological Site''' is a [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}. It can be used by players to interact with the [[Treasure Hunter]].

{{ZoneText |Talk to the Treasure Hunter.}}

== Location ==
In the middle of the area there's a campfire as well as a tent and some unmineable Gold Blocks. Around the campfire there are some Oak Logs as well as a hole with a Torch in it. 

